<header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="23" height="23" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="5" width="15" height="5" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="10" y="13" width="15" height="5" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="3" y="21" width="10" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor" opacity=".5"/></svg></div><div class="brand-name">Project <span>Planning Studio</span></div></div><div class="top-right"><span class="local-badge"><span class="dot"></span> Local workspace</span><button class="quiet-btn top-help" data-action="help" aria-label="Planner guide"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 2-2.5 2-2.5 4M12 16.5v.5"/></svg> <span>Quick guide</span></button></div></header>
<main class="app"><section class="project-heading"><div><div class="crumb eyebrow"><span>Workspace</span><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" stroke="currentColor" fill="none"><path d="m4 2 4 4-4 4"/></svg><span>Project 01</span></div><div class="project-title"><h1 id="project-name">Studio Launch</h1><button class="quiet-btn" data-action="project" aria-label="Edit project settings" title="Edit project name and start date"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="m15 5 4 4M5 15 16 4a2.8 2.8 0 0 1 4 4L9 19l-5 1z"/></svg></button></div><p class="subtitle">Make room for the work. See what moves your plan forward.</p></div><div class="actions"><div class="history-buttons"><button class="icon-btn" id="undo" data-action="undo" aria-label="Undo" title="Undo (Ctrl / ⌘ Z)" disabled></button><button class="icon-btn" id="redo" data-action="redo" aria-label="Redo" title="Redo (Ctrl / ⌘ Shift Z)" disabled></button></div><button class="btn" data-action="reset" id="reset">Reset</button><button class="btn" data-action="files" id="files"></button></div></section>
<section class="stats" id="summary" aria-label="Project summary"></section>
<div id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span id="status-icon"></span><span class="status-text"></span><button class="close-status" data-action="dismiss-status" aria-label="Dismiss message">×</button></div>
<div class="workspace" id="workspace"><div class="workspace-main"><section class="panel"><div class="view-toolbar"><nav class="view-tabs" aria-label="Workspace views"><button class="view-tab active" data-view="gantt">Gantt</button><button class="view-tab" data-view="tasks">Tasks</button><button class="view-tab" data-view="resources">Resources</button><button class="view-tab details-tab" data-view="details">Details</button></nav><div class="toolbar-tools"><label class="critical-toggle"><input id="critical-toggle" type="checkbox"><span>Critical path</span></label><button class="btn primary" data-action="new-task" id="new-task"></button></div></div>
<div class="view-panel" id="view-gantt"><div class="timeline-tools"><div><span class="timeline-title" id="timeline-title">September 2026</span><span class="timeline-sub">Working-day timeline</span></div><div class="zoom-tools"><button data-action="pan-left" aria-label="Pan earlier" title="Pan earlier"></button><button data-action="pan-right" aria-label="Pan later" title="Pan later"></button><span class="zoom-readout" id="zoom-readout"></span><button data-action="zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out" title="Zoom out"></button><button data-action="zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in" title="Zoom in"></button><button data-action="fit" aria-label="Fit timeline">Fit</button></div></div><div id="drag-preview" class="preview" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="timeline-body" id="timeline-body"><div class="gantt-labels" id="gantt-labels"></div><div class="timeline-viewport" id="timeline-viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Gantt timeline, scroll horizontally to pan"><div id="timeline"></div></div></div><div class="legend"><div class="legend-items"><span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch"></span>Task</span><span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch purple"></span>Dependency critical</span><span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch amber"></span>Resource wait</span><span class="legend-item"><span class="swatch diamond"></span>Milestone</span></div><span class="legend-note">// Weekend break · Mon–Fri</span></div></div>
<div class="view-panel" id="view-tasks" hidden><div class="table-heading"><span>Task register <small id="table-count"></small></span><label> <select id="task-order" aria-label="Display task order"><option value="source">Plan order</option><option value="id">Stable ID</option><option value="priority">Priority</option><option value="start">Actual start</option></select></label></div><div class="mobile-help">Scroll for more columns. Tap a task ID to open details.</div><div class="task-table-wrap"><table class="task-table"><thead><tr><th>Task ID</th><th>Name</th><th>Days</th><th>Priority</th><th>Resource</th><th>After</th><th>Actual interval</th><th>Dependency float</th></tr></thead><tbody id="task-table-body"></tbody></table></div><div class="table-foot">Edit a cell to recalculate. Lower priority runs first; stable IDs break ties.<br>Finish is an exclusive boundary. Positive tasks also show their last working date in Details.</div></div>
<div class="view-panel" id="view-resources" hidden><div class="resource-toolbar"><span class="resource-range" id="resource-range"></span><div class="zoom-tools"><button data-action="resource-earlier" aria-label="Earlier resource days"></button><button data-action="resource-later" aria-label="Later resource days"></button><button class="btn" data-action="manage-resources">Edit resources</button></div></div><div class="resource-grid-wrap" id="resource-grid-wrap"><div class="resource-grid" id="resource-grid"></div></div><div class="unassigned" id="unassigned"></div></div>
</section><section class="panel resource-strip" id="resource-strip"></section><div class="plan-note"><span id="policy-icon"></span><div><strong>A plan you can trace.</strong>Ready tasks are placed by priority, then stable ID. Each gets the earliest consecutive free working days after its dependencies and date constraint. Earlier resource gaps stay available. <button data-action="help">How scheduling works</button></div></div></div>
<aside class="panel inspector" id="inspector" aria-label="Task details"><div class="inspector-head"><span class="eyebrow">Task inspector</span><span class="task-id-pill" id="inspector-id"></span></div><div class="inspector-body" id="inspector-body"></div></aside></div>
<footer class="footer"><span class="session-note"><span class="dot"></span>Changes live in this tab. Download JSON to keep your work.</span><span>Dates 2000–2099 · Horizon 2,600 workdays · <button data-action="help">Limits &amp; guide</button></span></footer>
</main><nav class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile workspace views"><button data-view="gantt" class="active"></button><button data-view="tasks"></button><button data-view="resources"></button><button data-view="details"></button></nav>
